  "notes": "Single-replicate per-m2 conversions via the portal's calcBenthicAFDM/calcChlaPerM2 on a one-row frame; rock_surface_area_m2 is derived from convertToUnitPerM2(1, d, 1, 1) so the area formula stays the prelude's. Divergence from the Rust impl, portal followed: the portal requires all three sizeA/B/C dimensions for a per-m2 conversion, so two-diameter input yields the area but no AFDM/Chla conversion (Rust converts with any >= 2 diameters). The chla_ug_l input is mapped to the portal's chla_acid_ugL column; the tool does not distinguish acid/noacid, so chla_acid_ugm2 is the suggested code for the per-m2 output."
